<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to AnyLicence</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">

  <!-- Main Container -->
  <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;">

    <!-- Header -->
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px 5px;">
        <img style="width:140px; height:auto"
             src="https://static.anylicence.com/media/statics/logo.png"
             alt="AnyLicence" />
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Body -->
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

        <p><strong>Hi {{instructorName}},</strong></p>

        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>AnyLicence</strong> — we’re excited to have you join our community of trusted driving instructors.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your instructor account has been successfully created. Below are your temporary login details. You can update your password anytime after logging in.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Your Login Details:</strong></p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:20px; font-size:14px;">
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Email:</strong></td>
            <td>{{recipientEmail}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Temporary Password:</strong></td>
            <td><strong>{{password}}</strong></td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p><strong>Get Started in 3 Simple Steps:</strong></p>

        <ol style="padding-left:18px; margin-bottom:20px;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
            Log in to your Instructor Dashboard:
            <a href="{{login_url}}" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
              Login
            </a>
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
            Update your password and complete your profile: Add your photo, bio, service areas, pricing, Stripe/financial details, and vehicle details.
          </li>
          <li>
            Upload your credentials for verification: Submit your instructor licence, accreditations, and other required documents.
          </li>
        </ol>

        <p>
          Once your profile and documents are submitted, our team will review them for verification. After approval, you’ll start receiving genuine learner enquiries directly through your dashboard and email.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you need any help during setup, our support team is here for you at 
          <a href="mailto:support@anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
            support@anylicence.com.au
          </a>.
        </p>

        <p>
          We’re looking forward to supporting your success on AnyLicence.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Warm regards,</strong><br />
          Team AnyLicence<br />
          <a href="https://www.anylicence.com.au" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
            www.anylicence.com.au
          </a>
        </p>

      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px;"></td>
    </tr>

  </table>

</td>


  </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
